    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226040/extras/5cc04d535baf5dd6647374875fd95b04.avif?t=1727729660\" width=616 height=196 /></span><br><br>An exciting game in which you will find yourself in the role of a duck with a machine gun and will fight for your life. You will have to go through many trials and dangers to survive and become stronger.<br><br>In the game Duckiost, you control a duck that can shoot a machine gun. Your task is to fight off hunters who will try to kill you. <br>But not everything is so simple - the hunters will become stronger and stronger, and you will need to upgrade your machine gun to stay one step ahead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226040/extras/96b2371f1630c9a4e739468fc5681e41.poster.avif?t=1727729660\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226040/extras/96b2371f1630c9a4e739468fc5681e41.webm?t=1727729660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226040/extras/96b2371f1630c9a4e739468fc5681e41.mp4?t=1727729660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game controls are simple and intuitive: W, A, S, D - movement, left mouse button - shooting. You can aim and shoot in any direction, but be careful - ammo is limited<br>and you will have to choose carefully who to shoot at.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226040/extras/6cd2b65afabd7329e0bfa89052fa8fd9.poster.avif?t=1727729660\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226040/extras/6cd2b65afabd7329e0bfa89052fa8fd9.webm?t=1727729660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226040/extras/6cd2b65afabd7329e0bfa89052fa8fd9.mp4?t=1727729660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The main features of the game:<br><br>- Duck with a machine gun - you are not just a duck, you are a weapon capable of resisting hunters.<br>- Upgrade your machine gun - Upgrade your machine gun to increase its power and efficiency.<br>- Health system - take care of your health and try to avoid damage so as not to die.<br>- Intuitive controls** - Simple and intuitive controls will allow you to quickly get used to the game.<br><br><br>If you like run and shoot games, then Duckiost is an excellent choice. <br>Try your hand at being a warrior duck and see how ready you are to face the dangers!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226040/extras/5cc04d535baf5dd6647374875fd95b04.avif?t=1727729660\" width=616 height=196 /></span><br><br>An exciting game in which you will find yourself in the role of a duck with a machine gun and will fight for your life. You will have to go through many trials and dangers to survive and become stronger.<br><br>In the game Duckiost, you control a duck that can shoot a machine gun. Your task is to fight off hunters who will try to kill you. <br>But not everything is so simple - the hunters will become stronger and stronger, and you will need to upgrade your machine gun to stay one step ahead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226040/extras/96b2371f1630c9a4e739468fc5681e41.poster.avif?t=1727729660\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226040/extras/96b2371f1630c9a4e739468fc5681e41.webm?t=1727729660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226040/extras/96b2371f1630c9a4e739468fc5681e41.mp4?t=1727729660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game controls are simple and intuitive: W, A, S, D - movement, left mouse button - shooting. You can aim and shoot in any direction, but be careful - ammo is limited<br>and you will have to choose carefully who to shoot at.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226040/extras/6cd2b65afabd7329e0bfa89052fa8fd9.poster.avif?t=1727729660\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226040/extras/6cd2b65afabd7329e0bfa89052fa8fd9.webm?t=1727729660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226040/extras/6cd2b65afabd7329e0bfa89052fa8fd9.mp4?t=1727729660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The main features of the game:<br><br>- Duck with a machine gun - you are not just a duck, you are a weapon capable of resisting hunters.<br>- Upgrade your machine gun - Upgrade your machine gun to increase its power and efficiency.<br>- Health system - take care of your health and try to avoid damage so as not to die.<br>- Intuitive controls** - Simple and intuitive controls will allow you to quickly get used to the game.<br><br><br>If you like run and shoot games, then Duckiost is an excellent choice. <br>Try your hand at being a warrior duck and see how ready you are to face the dangers!",
